# A replacement effect is an ability too (CR 614.1, 613.1f): while Bot2's Dauthi Voidwalker has its abilities, Bot1's Shock is
# exiled with a void counter instead of going to Bot1's graveyard ("If a card would be put into an opponent's graveyard from
# anywhere, instead exile it"). Once Eaten by Piranhas enchants the Voidwalker, it has no replacement effect and no shadow, and
# Bot1's Lightning Bolt goes to Bot1's graveyard as it resolves.

